# The published StockLookup release artifacts are hash-verified against the sha256 values
# recorded in bundle_manifest.json, by tools/publish_release.py before promotion and by
# tests/release-smoke.test.js afterwards. This repository is checked out with
# core.autocrlf=true on Windows, which would rewrite every LF to CRLF on checkout and make
# the working-tree bytes disagree with the manifest that describes them. `-text` disables
# all end-of-line translation for exactly these files, so one release has one byte sequence
# on every platform, in the index, and on the served origin.
analysis_bundle.json            -text
bundle_manifest.json            -text
focus_extract.json              -text
statement_taxonomy_sidecar.json -text
